Source-bound M5 Gallium VDM Stream Link backport.
Target: aurora-silicon/mesa a8e86a80cdc4695d00e7e63b8ebea263e557431b,
with the original five-commit Mesa #194 series ending at 043a4c58080c4951fea3797fe45fc6898ce77632.
Upstream: Jens Axboe, 5cb0b3bda26c726a6aab1d1228c8bf6cc3045285,
https://github.com/aurora-silicon/mesa/pull/276
License: source file's MIT terms, retained in the Mesa source.
The existing agx_m5_vdm_compact and agx_vdm_stream_link_core_pack helpers
already support G17S in this base; Honeykrisp already uses them for this jump.
Only hunk location is adapted from the upstream patch. No register writes,
feature advertisement, admission changes, software selection or new constants.
Upstream hardware evidence is reported G17S/K116s, firmware 27.2, not this J716s/27.3.
No build, patch-application check or hardware test has been run here.

